<br/>
&zwnj;macOS Tahoe&zwnj; 26.5 adds a Suggested Places section to the search interface in the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-maps/">Apple Maps</a> app. It also lays the groundwork for ads in the Maps app, which are coming this summer.<br/>
<br/>
